<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">artisan's satchel</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

An <ansi fg="itemname">artisan's satchel</ansi> with padded dividers for
organizing crafting materials. An upgrade from the basic
component pouch, with more capacity and better weight relief.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Stats ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Capacity:</ansi>          20 items
  <ansi fg="yellow">Weight Reduction:</ansi>  35% of stored component weight
  <ansi fg="yellow">Slot:</ansi>              Components

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 15)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> leather strip (x2), cloth strip,
               thread spool (x2), bone needle

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help tailoring</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help sort</ansi>
